   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Even if that is so",
     "texto": [
      "To say «even if it is…» or «even if it happens…», use **-더라도**: 힘들**더라도** 끝까지 할 거예요 = even if it is hard, I will do it to the end. 비가 오**더라도** 가요 = even if it rains, we'll go."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Leaving something like that",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)ㄴ 채(로)** says that something stays in that state: 문을 연 **채로** 나갔어요 = (he/she) went out leaving the door open. 옷을 입은 **채로** 잤어요 = I slept with my clothes on."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
